      "Loaded 1000 saved trials from breakout_session_means.npy\n",
      "First 10 values of X: [1.  1.8 1.4 1.6 1.2 1.7 1.2 1.6 1.  1.2]\n",
      "Number of trials: 1000\n"
     ]
